References: <iHTRl98OVXQ.SB4Al1ruAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/iHTRl98OVXQ/m/vdN_Tb7vAQAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

If you only have two parameters, then it's easy.

...
model {
  vector[2] thetas;
  theta[1] <- theta;
  theta[2] <- sigma;
  ...
}

For more help, you'll need to be more specific. Stan's types aren't meant to be dynamically resized. (Bob, let me know if either that isn't true or if there's a better way to state that.)

Daniel

