You just need to make the dimensions match.  But I don't
see the equivalent thing in your BUGS model.  Where in the
BUGS model do you compute the same thing as

> b0[id[n]]  +   beta * xmat[n]

in the Stan model?  That's where you've declared something
the wrong size in Stan.

I'd start by using the exact same notation and doing an almost
line-by-line translation until you get the model working.  Then
you can work on making the Stan implementation more efficient.

- Bob

