>
> 	• stepsize (double, positive)
>
> 	• stepsize_jitter (double, [0,1])
>
> 	• metric (string, one of "unit_e", "diag_e", "dense_e")
>
> For algorithm HMC, we can also set
>
> 	• int_time (double, positive)
>
>
>
