It's no problem computing it with nested forward-mode autodiff.
Or reverse nested in forward.  In Stan terms, either types
fvar<fvar<double>> or fvar<var>.  In fact, we have functionals
in place to do it both ways for arbitrary functors.

I need to write the higher-order autodiff paper next!

