Subject: Multilevel beta-binomial
Message-ID: <n2F9jIUy5mc.kK2S2xKmBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/n2F9jIUy5mc/m/kK2S2xKmBAAJ>
