Hi Jonah,

Thanks for the helpful reply. It runs and seems to perform well. However, I still get errors like the following.

 <https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-y7bwFmzhboM/ViaNBQ5gXZI/AAAAAAAAAAk/J5YCBjsQ958/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2015-10-20%2Bat%2B2.52.30%2BPM.png>
