Subject: Re: [stan-users] Complex hierarchical model --- any hints?
Message-ID: <7HBIxlJEVJk.6yeMtnzeBQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <7HBIxlJEVJk.I01XfFPeBQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <7HBIxlJEVJk.Mmewd7eHBQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <7HBIxlJEVJk.I01XfFPeBQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
