Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Sichel Distribution (aka Poisson Generalized Inverse Gaussian distribution)
Message-ID: <sW61HeIT24I.uF6l9_KGBgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <sW61HeIT24I.cizlJl6CBgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
