Subject: separability avoiding cut-point priors for ordinal logit [was Re: [stan-users] Re: IRT/Differential Item Functioning]
Message-ID: <KCu4pzA-eBk.0aa5Yl5sAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <KCu4pzA-eBk.mONWCWcBCAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
