This is my last post on this topic. I will not be replying to any followups. My views are quite clear, I think. And they are supported by current scientific practice. This thread has been interesting but very stressful. I had no idea that I was holding views that were still considered controversial and perhaps also considered *shudder* wrong. Anyway, I love Stan, Bayes, and all that. Keep up the good work Andrew and the rest of the team!

Best wishes,

Simon.

